📑 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION & ARCHITECTURE BLUEPRINT: SHESCALE AI
Project Domain: PS22 - Comprehensive Ecosystem for Female Entrepreneurs (Funding, Mentorship, and Networking)

Development Timeline: 5-Day MVP Sprint

Core Architecture Philosophy: Independent Node.js Processing Engine with Real-Time Local RAG (Zero-Cost Framework)

🏗️ PART 1: SYSTEM TOPOLOGY & REAL-TIME DATA FLOW
To completely bypass the "AI Wrapper App" trap, SheScale AI operates as a stateful operational engine. The system continuously synchronizes user metrics with a localized memory infrastructure, intercepting raw API loops to inject dynamic context.

[User Text/Voice Input] 
